        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Compound weave in shades of green on an ivory ground.  Brocaded in ivory silk.  Undulating lacy ribbons, each intertwined with a floral vine.  Panel has another piece attached to each side. Side pieces cut with sections missing. Center panel has a selvedge on both sides? Very soiled, spotted and worn."@en ;
